    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d275-a2-a1">

                <pb facs="0788" n="574" xml:id="pg574"/>

                <p rendition="#right">
                    <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">San Francisco</hi></placeName>,<hi
                        rendition="#italic">October</hi> 30.</p>
                <p>This morning I had a long talk with Mr. Webb, the great ship-owner, of New York,
                    who arrived here last night, and I shall do my best to excite his interest and
                    his all-powerful aid in getting up a steam-line between this and the different
                    Central American ports.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>G. HOLLAND</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
